---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - ShadTools"
  description="ShadTools Privacy Policy. 100% in-browser processing guarantee. We do not store or transmit your files or conversion data."
  canonicalUrl="https://shadtools.com/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 glass-card my-12 p-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: August 7, 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. In-Browser Local Processing Guarantee</h2>
      <p>
        At ShadTools, your privacy is our top priority. All conversion, formatting, calculation, and image processing utilities operate 100% locally inside your web browser using HTML5 Web APIs, JavaScript, and WebAssembly.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your input text, uploaded files, images, code payloads, and calculation inputs are **never** uploaded to any external server, database, or third-party storage system.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Analytics & Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use lightweight, privacy-first Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure global pageviews and site traffic. Cloudflare Web Analytics does not use cookies, does not track individual users, and does not collect personal identification information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We may display display advertisements (such as Google AdSense) to support the ongoing maintenance of free tools. Third-party ad networks may use non-personal cookies to serve contextual advertisements.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
